<title>UK: Oftel revises price control for UK broadcasts.</title>
<headline>Oftel revises price control for UK broadcasts.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK telecommunications regulator Oftel on Monday announced a revised price control for charges by National Transcommunications Ltd on broadcast transmissions.</p>
<p>The charges, levied on the independent ITV channels and Channel Four, will have the total annual price levied by NTL cut by four million stg to 53.4 million from the beginning of 1997.</p>
<p>Thereafter, NTL will be required to cut its prices by four percent per annum until 2002, after allowing for inflation.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
